351
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,520
那至少戴上我的围巾 现在很冷
Please, at least take my scarf. It's cold.

352
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:00,780
不用了 我不冷
No, I'm fine--

353
00:15:03,700 --> 00:15:05,660
-你没事吧 我来扶你 -不用了 尼可拉斯
- Are you okay? Here, let me help. - No, Nicolas.

354
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:08,040
我不会当小三的
I am not going to be the other woman.

355
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,700
虽然我现在正躺在垃圾堆里
Despite the fact that I am literally lying in trash,

356
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:12,060
但我不是那种垃圾女人
I am not trashy.

357
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,560
卡洛琳 听着
Caroline, listen.

358
00:15:18,260 --> 00:15:20,580
事情并不总是像表面看起来那样
Things aren't always what they seem.

359
00:15:20,660 --> 00:15:22,940
因为它从表面看是个垃圾箱
Just because that is garbage on the outside

360
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:24,640
并不意味着它里面
doesn't mean that it cannot be

361
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:26,020
不能是一间装修精美的公寓
a nice apartment on the inside.

362
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:28,240
因为我从表面上看似已婚
Just because I'm married on the outside

363
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,900
并不意味着我心里面真的有我老婆
doesn't mean I'm married on the inside.

364
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:32,460
人生很复杂
Life is complex.

365
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:35,320
你的整个理论都是基于我会认为
Your whole thesis is hinged on the fact

366
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:37,600
那个垃圾箱里面装修得还不错
that I think that dumpster is nice on the inside,

367
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:40,060
但我我一点也不这么认为 晚安
which I don't. Good night.

368
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,606
-卡洛琳 -尼可拉斯 别求了
- Oh, Caroline-- - Nicolas, please don't beg.

369
00:15:42,606 --> 00:15:44,926
-我是想说 -或许下辈子吧
- I just-- - Maybe another world, another life.

370
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:47,300
-我想 -你不能为了我而抛弃你的老婆
- I want-- - You can't leave your wife for me.

371
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:49,560
-不是的 -说真的 你什么都不必说了
- No, it's just-- - Seriously! You don't have to say it.

372
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:50,440
不 我一定要说
No, I do.

373
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:52,820
你衣服后面粘上纸尿布了
You have a diaper on your back.

374
00:15:55,500 --> 00:15:56,420
我知道
I am aware.

375
00:16:07,460 --> 00:16:08,760
你在那弄什么呢
What are you working on there?

376
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,660
是一家人在公园里野餐吗
Is that a family having a picnic at a park?

377
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,540
不 这是字母"G"
No, it's the letter "G"!

378
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,680
从1996年开始 我就没怎么用手写过字
I haven't written anything by hand since 1996.

379
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:19,280
我的字可是很牛哦
Well, my writing's really good.

380
00:16:19,300 --> 00:16:21,060
我伪造过很多支票和医药处方
I forge a lot of checks and prescriptions.

381
00:16:22,380 --> 00:16:23,760
我也算是个著名"医生"
I'm kind of a famous doctor.

382
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:31,600
你真的说出来了
You're really saying it.

383
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,440
你写的是 "我爱你"
That says, "I love you."

384
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:35,180
不 这是卡戴珊她妹在玩风帆
No, it's Khloe Kardashian windsurfing.

385
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:39,080
没错 迪克 我爱你
Yes, Deke, I love you.

386
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:42,660
碧碧
Oh, Bebe.

387
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:45,580
我还以为你今天要走 不会来办公室了
I wasn't expecting you today. I thought you moved.

388
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,500
我是要走啊 我的车就在外面
I'm on my way. My car's outside,

389
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,740
但我想起来我把药落在这里了
but I remembered I left my medication here.

390
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,080
好了 大袋的在哪里呢
Okay, now where's the big one?

391
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:00,280
既然你在这
Well, as long as you're here,

392
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,420
你能告诉我学生的财务档案放在哪里吗
could you show me where the student financial files are?

393
00:17:02,420 --> 00:17:04,560
当然 它们被放在一个
Sure, they're here in this folder

394
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,060
名为"压抑"的文件夹
I've labeled "depressing."

395
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:09,300
我想看看迪克是不是靠奖学金念书
I wanna check Deke's file and see if he's on scholarship.

396
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,480
他怎么可能靠奖学金念书
He's definitely not on scholarship.

397
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,520
他家超级有钱 他是布朗伯格家族的
His family's super rich. He's a Bromberg.

398
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:16,080
等等 碧碧 你是说布朗伯格吗
Wait, Bebe. Bromberg?

399
00:17:16,460 --> 00:17:18,620
迪克的姓不是"伯格"吗
I thought Deke's last name was just "Berg."

400
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,600
像是"冰山"或"皮茨" 就两个字
As in "Ice" Or "Pitts."

401
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:24,000
不是 他用"伯格"是为了省事
No, he just goes by Berg for short.

402
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,640
像我 我的全名是碧碧碧碧
You know, like me, my full name is Bebebebe.

403
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:33,860
所以你是说迪克是布朗伯格家族的
So you're telling me Deke is from the Bromberg family,

404
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,720
就是那个著名的布朗伯格电梯
As in the Bromberg elevators--

405
00:17:35,800 --> 00:17:37,780
全市每一栋大楼用的电梯都是他们生产的
the ones that are in every building in the city?

406
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,400
就是那个在纽约医院有以布朗伯格
As in the Bromberg colo-rectal center

407
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,300
命名的肛肠检查中心吗
at the New York hospital?

408
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:43,120
没错
Yeah.

409
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:45,320
我曾在那丢过一个钱包
You know, I once left a purse

410
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:47,540
还切掉过我两英尺的大肠
and 2 feet of my large intestine there.

411
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,180
很高兴认识你 再见
Nice knowing you. Bye.

412
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:56,800
我马上回来
Ooh, I'll be right back.

413
00:17:57,100 --> 00:17:58,000
如果你把我们的奶油搞砸
If you mess up our batter,

414
00:17:58,060 --> 00:17:58,940
我会把你那玩意切下来
I'll cut your thing off.

415
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:02,860
好啊 少个5磅对我来说没什么关系
Sweet, I could stand to lose 5 pounds.

416
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,200
我有个好消息要跟你分享
I have some exciting news to share.

417
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:10,260
除非是关于淡季的三叶草奶昔
Unless it's about an off-season shamrock shake,

418
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:10,720
否则我不感兴趣
I don't care.

419
00:18:11,188 --> 00:18:13,641
你的迪克 垃圾箱迪克
Your Deke--dumpster Deke--

420
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:16,020
真名叫迪肯·布朗伯格
is actually Deacon Bromberg.

421
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:18,700
是曼哈顿布朗伯格家族的 他是有钱人
of the Manhattan Brombergs! He's rich!

422
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,580
你在瞎说什么 这太扯了吧
What are you talking about? That is crazy.

423
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:22,060
如果他是有钱人 我会知道
I would know if he were rich.

424
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:23,960
我绝不会对一个有钱人说我爱他
I wouldn't have just told a rich guy I love him.

425
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:26,120
资料都在这里 是不是很棒
It's all right here. Isn't this amazing?

426
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,620
感觉就像你买了一条喜欢的裙子
This is like buying a dress you love

427
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:29,880
结果发现这裙子很有钱
and finding out it's rich.

428
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:38,880
你干嘛这样做
Whoa, why'd you do that?

429
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,580
-谁让你是有钱人 -麦克斯 别走
- You're rich. - Max, wait.

430
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:44,120
你还在那装穷 骗子
You pretended to be poor. Liar.

431
00:18:46,258 --> 00:18:49,000
我的老天
Ooh, lordy be.

432
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,420
我就是爱看这样的戏码
This kind of drama's the reason

433
00:18:50,420 --> 00:18:52,580
所以我才退出俄亥俄州立大学足球队
why I quit the Ohio state football team.

434
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:01,300
你为什么这么郁闷
Why are you so upset?

435
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:04,400
隐瞒自己是个有钱人是最善意的谎言了
Lying about being rich is at most a little white lie.

436
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:07,778
这是我听过最白痴的谎言
It is literally the whitest lie I have ever heard,

437
00:19:07,778 --> 00:19:09,640
这事很严重
and it's a huge deal.

438
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,740
我从来不会爱上一个有钱人
I never would have fallen in love with someone who has money.

439
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,360
我们真是超级非常
We are drastically, massively,

440
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:15,920
十分不同的人
monumentally different people.

441
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:19,960
-麦克斯 能说句话吗 -我不知道
- Hey, Max, can we talk? - Oh, I don't know.

442
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,480
那要看跟谁说话了
Depends on who I'm talking to.

443
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:24,580
我是跟迪克 还是迪肯·布朗伯格
Am I talking to Deke or Deacon Bromberg,

444
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:25,700
电梯大王讲话
the elevator king?

445
00:19:26,340 --> 00:19:28,120
天啊 如果你因为钱反应就这样
Man, if you're this upset about the money,

446
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:29,660
如果你发现我其实是女人的话
how are you gonna react when you find out

447
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:30,420
那反应会是怎么样
I'm really a woman?

448
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:34,100
我们不介意的
We wouldn't care.

449
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:37,960
在我们互诉爱意之前
I never tell anybody I'm rich

450
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,320
我从未告诉别人我的家世
until after we say I love you

451
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:40,960
因为我不想让钱改变任何东西
because I don't want money to change anything.

452
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:44,080
钱能改变一切
Money changes everything!

453
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,280
恕我失陪
Now excuse me.

454
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:46,940
我要忙我第二份工作的事了
I gotta do my second job,

455
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:48,380
想必你对这方面完全没有过体验吧
which you wouldn't know anything about.

456
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:50,900
你不是得去个啥领巾大会之类的吗
Don't you have an ascot convention to get to?

457
00:19:52,041 --> 00:19:54,000
我还在
Still here.

458
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,940
你们来了两个客人呢
Also, two customers just showed up.

459
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:57,920
我们才不需要他们的钱
We don't need their money!

460
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,600
我们也是假装穷人的大骗子
We're big, fat liars pretending to be poor too.

461
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:03,960
没错 我妈发明了狗
Mm, yeah, my mom invented dogs.

462
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:07,380
只要有人买狗 就会有一成卖价进我们的口袋
Any time someone buys a dog, we get 10%!

463
00:20:09,340 --> 00:20:11,120
现在换我不敢相信了
Now I can't believe it.

464
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:13,320
你都跟我做了3年的朋友了
Even after three years with me as a friend,

465
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,260
你心里还是仇视有钱人
you still have a thing against rich people.

466
00:20:15,700 --> 00:20:17,400
没错 因为有钱人都是混蛋
I do, because rich people suck.

467
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:18,880
他们觉得自己强过所有人
They think they're better than everyone

468
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:20,160
而且通常都是烂人
and are generally sucky.

469
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,420
所以他有钱 姐不想要
So he has money, I don't want it.

470
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:25,180
又一次证明你我完全是两类人
Again, just wildly different people.

471
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:27,920
麦克斯 因为他表面看起来是有钱人
And, Max, just because he's rich on the outside

472
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,080
不代表他内心里面跟你就不一样啊
doesn't mean he's not like you on the inside.

473
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,480
人生很复杂
Life is complex.

474
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:34,721
我现在不想看到你
I don't wanna see you right now!

475
00:20:34,721 --> 00:20:38,413
我也不想看到你
Hey! I don't wanna see you either.

476
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:39,960
给我丢些里面有奶油的
Just toss me something chocolate

477
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,160
巧克力口味小蛋糕就行
with some cream in the middle.

478
00:20:42,660 --> 00:20:44,260
说到里面有奶油[精液]
And speaking of cream in the middle,

479
00:20:44,360 --> 00:20:47,140
你的无家可归小男友想吸引你注意呢
your little homeless boyfriend is trying to get your attention.

480
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:52,080
他不是无家可归 他也不是我男朋友
He's not homeless. He's not my boyfriend.

481
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:52,937
他是有钱人
He's rich.

482
00:20:52,937 --> 00:20:57,171
有钱人 而且还单身吗
Rich? And he's single?

483
00:20:57,640 --> 00:21:00,300
看来姐还是去"脱下高跟鞋"吧
Oh, maybe I will take off my heels.
